or_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":"黑跃左马，再弃7卒，均为争先，为发动攻势做好准备。","text":"黑跃左马，再弃7卒，均为争先，为发动攻势做好准备。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":"黑左炮邀兑是及时的好棋，可形成左右夹击之势。","text":"黑左炮邀兑是及时的好棋，可形成左右夹击之势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment36:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment36","raw_text":"红如改走车八退一，见变例。现黑吃子简洁，以下红如炮六平三，则马3退5得子。","text":"红如改走车八退一，见变例。现黑吃子简洁，以下红如炮六平三，则马3退5得子。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":36,"anchor_node_id":"0:36","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"此时形势，黑进炮底线，弃车杀王，着法凶狠有力，是预计中的着法。","text":"此时形势，黑进炮底线，弃车杀王，着法凶狠有力，是预计中的着法。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment42:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment42","raw_text":"马踏底士，已成杀势，红无良策。","text":"马踏底士，已成杀势，红无良策。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":42,"anchor_node_id":"0:42","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment46:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment46","raw_text":"黑胜。","text":"黑胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":46,"anchor_node_id":"0:46","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_46:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_46","raw_text":"黑优。","text":"黑优。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":46,"anchor_node_id":"1:46","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["贵州刘世镇 先负 湖北柳大华"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_open":[" 中炮左边马对屏风马"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":16,"id